[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、今日もいい天気！\n絶好の航海日和っすわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mm, another beautiful day! Perfect weather for sailing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "出航して５日目だってのに、元気だね。\n普通ならとっくに水平線なんか見飽きるもんよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've been at sea for five days and you're still this energetic. Most folks would be sick of staring at the horizon by now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "バーバラ号の船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain of the Barbara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ……国をここまで離れるのは初めてだから。\n大変な事件が起きようとしてるのに不謹慎かもだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe... This is my first time traveling so far from home. I know something terrible is happening, so maybe it's inappropriate to be excited, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "道中どう過ごしても同じなら\n楽しく過ごしたほうがいいんじゃないかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If the journey's going to take the same amount of time either way, might as well enjoy it, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ですよねーぃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ殿の雰囲気が、少し変わったでござるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Great Lady Alvina's demeanor seems somewhat different now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こっちが本来の彼女なんだろう。魅力的じゃないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This must be her true self. Quite charming, isn't she?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あと鬼門、ござるは古い口調だからと\n鏑矢に禁止されているだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Also, Kimon, didn't Kaburaya tell you not to speak like that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おっと、そうだった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, you're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今日は陸が見えるかな？\u3000\nトトリさん、そっちはどうっす？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think we'll hit land today? Totori, how's it looking over there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっとね……なんか見えるよ？\nでも、島っぽい感じじゃなくて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, well... there might be something? It doesn't look like an island though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A monster...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "げっ！？\u3000み、皆の者ー！\n敵襲、敵襲ー！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yikes! Everyone! We're under attack!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]